Source: svent-boot
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: z1rov <fabian@zirov.net>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: svent-boot
Architecture: all
Depends: grub2-common, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Svent installed-system GRUB boot integration
 Installs a managed /etc/default/grub.d drop-in that gives the installed
 system a classic text GRUB menu in red on black. No theme or graphics
 mode, so the kernel handoff stays reliable on bare metal and in VMs.